...
This is the result of a limitation in Vega (we cannot sort unioned domains) and the fact that we don't currently merge the sort properties because the two dataflows for the two layers have some differences that we cannot merge in the general case.
...
We need to apply a few tree transforms to the dataflow graph but this is not trivial to get right in general but this issue has high priority for me.

